sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant T as TUI
    participant S as Script generator
    participant C as Clipboard (pbcopy)
    U->>T: choose option 1
    T->>S: build from analysis result (no new DB query)
    S-->>T: delete script + restore script
    T->>U: show scripts
    U->>T: /copy delete | /copy restore | /copy
    T->>C: pbcopy
    Note over U: User reviews and runs the script elsewhere.<br/>BlastGuard never executes it.
